<body>
<p t="2853" d="4905" wp="2" ws="1"><s p="2">​</s><s>​</s><s p="3">​ ​kuu-neru engazer​ ​</s><s p="2">​</s></p>
<p t="2853" d="4905" wp="3" ws="1"><s p="4">​</s><s>​</s><s p="5">​ ​denǂkujira​ ​</s><s p="4">​</s></p>
<p t="8492" d="1902" wp="4" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="7">​ ​The world was frozen.​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="10694" d="3003" wp="4" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="7">​ ​Through such unprecedented coldness​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="14198" d="2302" wp="4" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="7">​ ​the roads and the sky​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="17001" d="1701" wp="4" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="7">​ ​were frozen white and blue.​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="18702" d="301" wp="4" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="8">​ ​were frozen white and blue.​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="19003" d="400" wp="4" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="7">​ ​were frozen white and blue.​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="19403" d="200" wp="4" ws="1"><s p="9">​</s><s>​</s><s p="10">​ ​were frozen white and blue.​ ​</s><s p="9">​</s></p>
<p t="19803" d="1902" wp="4" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="7">​ ​It was too quiet.​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="22006" d="6006" wp="4" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="7">​ ​The frozen night entered people’s lungs​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="28312" d="1902" wp="4" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="11">​ ​and they shattered to pieces.​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="32516" d="1869" wp="4" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="11">​ ​The pair looked out​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="34585" d="3103" wp="4" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="11">​ ​at the landscape and got scared.​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="38188" d="2303" wp="4" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="11">​ ​They took shallow,​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="40991" d="1201" wp="4" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="11">​ ​white breaths.​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="42493" d="1001" wp="4" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="7">​ ​hipo, hipo, see, ze​ ​</s><s p="6">​
​</s><s p="7">​ ​[Cough, cough, hah… hah.]​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="43894" d="1502" wp="4" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="11">​ ​I’ll make some cream-of-corn soup,​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="45896" d="3003" wp="5" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="11">​ ​even though winter will slip​ ​</s><s p="6">​
​</s><s p="11">​ ​ through the cracks in the window​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="49500" d="2302" wp="5" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="7">​ ​and my thoughts and dreams​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="52302" d="401" wp="6" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="7">​ ​will be frozen solid​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="52302" d="401" wp="7" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="7">​ ​before long…​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="52703" d="67" wp="6" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="12">​ ​will be frozen solid​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="52703" d="67" wp="7" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="12">​ ​before long…​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="52770" d="66" wp="6" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="13">​ ​will be frozen solid​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="52770" d="66" wp="7" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="13">​ ​before long…​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="52836" d="67" wp="6" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="14">​ ​will be frozen solid​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="52836" d="67" wp="7" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="14">​ ​before long…​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="52903" d="67" wp="6" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="15">​ ​will be frozen solid​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="52903" d="67" wp="7" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="15">​ ​before long…​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="52970" d="67" wp="6" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="16">​ ​will be frozen solid​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
<p t="52970" d="67" wp="7" ws="1"><s p="6">​</s><s>​</s><s p="16">​ ​before long…​ ​</s><s p="6">​</s></p>
